@node LibreClaw
@chapter LibreClaw Chat/Matrix Integration

LibreClaw is an AI-agent gateway (Matrix, email, webhook, local CLI)
embedded inside cmacs as the @code{cmacs-libreclaw} subsystem.  It runs
inside Emacs on cmacs's GMainContext, shares cmacs's podomation engine,
and surfaces each room as an org-mode buffer in the style of ellama.

This chapter is mirrored in @file{doc_org/cmacs/libreclaw/} — the Org
files are the primary interactive reference and the two directories
must stay in sync.  Run @file{tools/sync-docs.sh} to verify.

